3: ABAP-METHODS-001: each section and parameter on its own line
16: ABAP-STMT-001: each statement on its own line
18: ABAP-CALL-001: one parameter per line, because the call would end at column 132 (limit 120)
25: ABAP-VALUE-001: one row per line, because the constructor expression would end at column 145 (limit 120)
28: ABAP-COND-001: condition split before AND, OR, because the condition would end at column 121 (limit 120)
